CosmicTiger build targets

  cosmictiger       Build the application with the enabled capabilities.
  cosmictiger_help  Show this guide.

Enabled capabilities:
  FMM: @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_FMM@
  PMMM PP: @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_PMMM_PP@
  PMMM FMM: @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_PMMM_FMM@
  SPH: @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_SPH@
  Particle chemistry: @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_CHEMISTRY@ (requires SPH)
  Traditional integration: @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_INTEGRATOR_TRADITIONAL@
  Hierarchical integration: @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_INTEGRATOR_HIERARCHICAL@
  Global integration: @COSMICTIGER_ENABLE_INTEGRATOR_GLOBAL@
  Potential expansion degrees: @COSMICTIGER_EXPANSION_DEGREE@
  Particle positions: @COSMICTIGER_POSITION_TYPE@

Select enabled algorithms at runtime with gravity.method.far,
gravity.method.near, and run.timeIntegrator. Select a compiled potential
degree with gravity.expansionDegree. Run cosmictiger --help for details.
